<BlogLayout
  title="What good Google marketing looks like for trades"
  seoTitle="What Good Google Marketing Looks Like for Trades"
  description="LSA, Search, map pack, and website as one system for home service companies, and what winning should look like in booked work, not vanity metrics."
  date="September 2026"
